{"id":"1615ef12adfef528","group":"88","path":"88/88-cor-ce-complement.md","title":"CE Complement Corollary","display":"cor-ce-complement — CE Complement Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-cor-ce-complement","aliases":["88-cor-ce-complement"],"display":"cor-ce-complement — CE Complement Corollary","depends_on":["[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[88-df-decidable-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-cor-ce-complement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-cor-ce-complement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-ce-complement — CE Complement Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (set of natural numbers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> (computably enumerable predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ce\\text{-}complement} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\n\\to\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ce\\text{-}complement} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\n\\to\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span>与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span>均按上游作为谓词使用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\setminus A\">\\(\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\)</span> : 相对于自然数域的补集</li>\n<li>CE及其补都是CE则可判定</li>\n<li>Post定理的基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}(A)$ (computably enumerable predicate, see [[88-df-ce-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)$ (decidable-set predicate, see [[88-df-decidable-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ce\\text{-}complement} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\n\\to\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\setminus A","display":false}],"bytes":893,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["b283fc95a9b1376d","a6c52aed1a56207b"]}